  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Let's quickly recap what we learned.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2000,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 60,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "We started with the counting approach because the array contains only 0, 1, and 2.",
      "start_ms": 2720,
      "end_ms": 10540,
      "start_frame": 82,
      "end_frame": 316,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "We counted how many of each value we had and then rewrote the array.",
      "start_ms": 11240,
      "end_ms": 16220,
      "start_frame": 337,
      "end_frame": 487,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "That gave us O of n time and O of 1 extra space.",
      "start_ms": 16840,
      "end_ms": 21800,
      "start_frame": 505,
      "end_frame": 654,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "But it still needed two passes.",
      "start_ms": 22220,
      "end_ms": 24020,
      "start_frame": 667,
      "end_frame": 721,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we improved it.",
      "start_ms": 24360,
      "end_ms": 26480,
      "start_frame": 731,
      "end_frame": 794,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the Dutch national flag pattern, we used three pointers, low, mid, and high.",
      "start_ms": 26480,
      "end_ms": 33260,
      "start_frame": 794,
      "end_frame": 998,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "And those three pointers maintained four regions, confirmed zeros, confirmed ones, unknown values, and confirmed twos.",
      "start_ms": 34120,
      "end_ms": 43060,
      "start_frame": 1024,
      "end_frame": 1292,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "If nums at mid is 0, move it to the left, then move low and mid.",
      "start_ms": 43640,
      "end_ms": 48840,
      "start_frame": 1309,
      "end_frame": 1465,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "If nums at mid is 1, it already belongs in the middle.",
      "start_ms": 49520,
      "end_ms": 53300,
      "start_frame": 1486,
      "end_frame": 1599,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "So just move mid.",
      "start_ms": 53820,
      "end_ms": 55060,
      "start_frame": 1615,
      "end_frame": 1652,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "And if nums at mid is 2, move it to the right, move high left.",
      "start_ms": 55060,
      "end_ms": 60460,
      "start_frame": 1652,
      "end_frame": 1814,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "But keep mid where it is.",
      "start_ms": 61160,
      "end_ms": 63140,
      "start_frame": 1835,
      "end_frame": 1894,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "That last rule is important because the value coming from high is still unknown.",
      "start_ms": 63800,
      "end_ms": 69380,
      "start_frame": 1914,
      "end_frame": 2081,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "With this idea, we solved the problem in one pass, using O of n time and O of 1 extra space.",
      "start_ms": 70140,
      "end_ms": 78120,
      "start_frame": 2104,
      "end_frame": 2344,
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "But the bigger lesson is not just sort colors.",
      "start_ms": 78480,
      "end_ms": 81760,
      "start_frame": 2354,
      "end_frame": 2453,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Whenever a problem has only a few categories, think about partitioning.",
      "start_ms": 81760,
      "end_ms": 88000,
      "start_frame": 2453,
      "end_frame": 2640,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask yourself what part is already confirmed, what part is still unknown, and which pointers protect those boundaries.",
      "start_ms": 88180,
      "end_ms": 96460,
      "start_frame": 2645,
      "end_frame": 2894,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "That way, you are not just memorizing a solution, you are learning an invariant that can help in many other partition problems.",
      "start_ms": 97060,
      "end_ms": 106460,
      "start_frame": 2912,
      "end_frame": 3194,
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "And with that, sort colors is complete.",
      "start_ms": 107120,
      "end_ms": 110480,
      "start_frame": 3214,
      "end_frame": 3314,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Question 11, done.",
      "start_ms": 111000,
      "end_ms": 113000,
      "start_frame": 3330,
      "end_frame": 3390,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "We continue our arrays and hashing roadmap with the next problem.",
      "start_ms": 114020,
      "end_ms": 119440,
      "start_frame": 3421,
      "end_frame": 3583,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Next permutation.",
      "start_ms": 120460,
      "end_ms": 121400,
      "start_frame": 3614,
      "end_frame": 3642,
      "word_count": 2
    }
